  "integration.tab_ai": "Build with AI",
  "integration.tab_api": "Step-by-step (API Key)",
  "integration.ai_intro": "Fastest path: copy the prompt below, paste it into an AI coding assistant (Claude, Cursor, etc.), replace the placeholders with your API key. The AI will build the backend proxy + frontend integration in your app.",
  "integration.ai_prompt_label": "Prompt for your AI agent",
  "integration.ai_note": "Important: the API key is a secret. Keep it on your backend and call Netra from there — never put it in browser code.",
  "integration.guide_users_title": "6. Pull users + enrolled status",
  "integration.guide_users_desc": "To show who has/hasn't enrolled their face (scope users:read).",
  "integration.guide_push_title": "6b. Push/sync your roster (write)",
  "integration.guide_push_desc": "POST /integration/users — send your employee list into Netra so records exist before enrollment (scope users:write). Send one object or an array (max 500/request). It is idempotent by external_id: replay your full roster any time — existing people are updated, not duplicated. Synced users then show up in the Manage Users menu.",
  "integration.guide_push_resp": "The response confirms the request was applied: each row has a created flag (true = new, false = updated), plus a summary of received/created/updated so your app knows exactly what happened.",
  "integration.guide_embed_title": "7. Embed enrollment (capture face inside your app)",
  "integration.guide_embed_desc": "Your backend mints a one-time session, your frontend renders the URL in an <iframe>. Listen for the result via postMessage.",
  "integration.guide_webhook_title": "8. Webhook (optional, real-time)",
  "integration.guide_webhook_desc": "Register an endpoint to receive attendance.check_in / attendance.check_out / enrollment.completed events in real time (HMAC-signed).",
  "integration.step1_title": "Step 1 — Create an API Key",
  "integration.step1_body": "Click \"Create API Key\" above. The token is shown once — copy it, store it safely, and hand it to your app's developer.",
  "integration.step2_title": "Step 2 — Build the integration in your app",
  "integration.step2_choose": "Pick one approach:",
  "integration.mode_ai": "🚀 Use AI (fast)",
  "integration.mode_manual": "🔧 Manual (API)",
  "integration.step3_title": "Step 3 — Embed enrollment (capture faces inside your app)",
  "integration.step3_note": "Note: your app's domain must be on this API key's embed allowlist (\"Manage Origins\" button on the key card above) for the iframe to be allowed. If mint returns 403, add your origin first.",
  "integration.step4_title": "Step 4 — Test, go real-time, then go live",
  "integration.step4_body": "Pull data using the Step 2 examples to confirm the connection. For automatic updates (no polling), register a webhook to receive events in real time.",
